sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Session A (user 1)
    participant DB as Oracle (RESOURCES row 12)
    participant B as Session B (user 2)
    A->>DB: SELECT ... FROM resources WHERE id=12 FOR UPDATE WAIT 5
    DB-->>A: row lock granted
    B->>DB: SELECT ... FROM resources WHERE id=12 FOR UPDATE WAIT 5
    Note over B,DB: B blocks: row already locked by A
    A->>DB: overlap check (sees no conflict)
    A->>DB: INSERT booking 10:00-12:00
    A->>DB: COMMIT (lock released)
    DB-->>B: row lock granted
    B->>DB: overlap check (new statement: sees A's committed row)
    DB-->>B: ORA-20005 Time slot conflicts with booking #A
    Note over B: API rolls back B and returns HTTP 409
